  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Coordination and Logistics for Combi-Tracks in Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Netherlands Embassy and Consulate in Nigeria and the Netherlands Enterprise Agency are working on the implementation of two combi-tracks in Nigeria: 1.	Integrated off-grid solar solutions; and2.	Horticulture in Nigeria.Within these two combi-tracks, there will be several (trade) missions, events, workshops, field visits organised, preparatory studies carried out and communication materials developed. The primary objective of this project is to enhance the quality and efficiency of these activities by making a flexible budget available to purchase or rent services locally and quickly to support the implementation of the above mentioned two combi-tracks in Nigeria.</narrative>
  </description>
